<mjml><mj-head><!-- VISIBILITY_STYLES --><mj-style>
      /* Desktop-first : les clients qui ne supportent pas @media
         (Outlook Web, Nouveau Outlook) gardent le comportement desktop. */
      .desktop-only, .desktop-only-outlook, [class*="desktop-only"] {
        display: block;
        width: auto;
        max-height: none;
        overflow: visible;
        line-height: inherit;
      }
      .mobile-only, .mobile-only-outlook, [class*="mobile-only"] {
        display: none;
        width: 0;
        max-height: 0;
        overflow: hidden;
        line-height: 0;
      }
      /* Mobile : afficher mobile-only, masquer desktop-only */
      @media only screen and (max-width:599px) {
        .desktop-only, .desktop-only-outlook, [class*="desktop-only"] {
          display: none !important;
          width: 0 !important;
          max-height: 0 !important;
          overflow: hidden !important;
          line-height: 0 !important;
          mso-hide: all !important;
        }
        .mobile-only, .mobile-only-outlook, [class*="mobile-only"] {
          display: block !important;
          width: auto !important;
          max-height: none !important;
          overflow: visible !important;
          line-height: inherit !important;
          mso-hide: none !important;
        }
      }
      /* Desktop explicit (pour spécificité) */
      @media only screen and (min-width:600px) {
        .desktop-only, .desktop-only-outlook, [class*="desktop-only"] {
          display: block !important;
          width: auto !important;
          max-height: none !important;
          overflow: visible !important;
          line-height: inherit !important;
          mso-hide: none !important;
        }
        .mobile-only, .mobile-only-outlook, [class*="mobile-only"] {
          display: none !important;
          width: 0 !important;
          max-height: 0 !important;
          overflow: hidden !important;
          line-height: 0 !important;
          mso-hide: all !important;
        }
      }
      /* Fallback : vrais appareils mobiles (Outlook mobile peut avoir un viewport &gt;600px) */
      @media only screen and (max-device-width:599px) {
        .mobile-only, .mobile-only-outlook, [class*="mobile-only"] {
          display: block !important;
          width: auto !important;
          max-height: none !important;
          overflow: visible !important;
          line-height: inherit !important;
          mso-hide: none !important;
        }
        .desktop-only, .desktop-only-outlook, [class*="desktop-only"] {
          display: none !important;
          width: 0 !important;
          max-height: 0 !important;
          overflow: hidden !important;
          line-height: 0 !important;
          mso-hide: all !important;
        }
      }
    </mj-style><!--[if mso | IE]>
      <style type="text/css">
        .desktop-only, .desktop-only-outlook, [class*="desktop-only"] {
          display: block !important;
          width: auto !important;
          max-height: none !important;
          overflow: visible !important;
          line-height: inherit !important;
          mso-hide: none !important;
        }
        .mobile-only, .mobile-only-outlook, [class*="mobile-only"] {
          display: none !important;
          width: 0 !important;
          max-height: 0 !important;
          overflow: hidden !important;
          line-height: 0 !important;
          mso-hide: all !important;
        }
        table.desktop-only, table.desktop-only-outlook, table[class*="desktop-only"],
        tr.desktop-only, tr.desktop-only-outlook, tr[class*="desktop-only"],
        td.desktop-only, td.desktop-only-outlook, td[class*="desktop-only"] {
          display: table !important;
          width: auto !important;
          max-height: none !important;
          overflow: visible !important;
          line-height: inherit !important;
          mso-hide: none !important;
        }
        table.mobile-only, table.mobile-only-outlook, table[class*="mobile-only"],
        tr.mobile-only, tr.mobile-only-outlook, tr[class*="mobile-only"],
        td.mobile-only, td.mobile-only-outlook, td[class*="mobile-only"] {
          display: none !important;
          width: 0 !important;
          max-height: 0 !important;
          overflow: hidden !important;
          line-height: 0 !important;
          mso-hide: all !important;
        }
      </style>
    <![endif]--><mj-attributes><mj-all padding="0">
            </mj-all></mj-attributes><mj-font name="Lora" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap"></mj-font><mj-style>@media only screen and (max-width:479px){.h1 div{font-size:34px!important;line-height:39px!important;}.rows td{display:block!important;width:100%!important;}}</mj-style><mj-preview>Des chambres à deux pas de chez vous, pour ceux qui viennent fêter Noël.</mj-preview></mj-head><mj-body background-color="#F7F1E8" width="600px"><mj-section padding="0"><mj-column><mj-image css-class="tf-logo" src="https://api.trigger-flow.com/images/email-library/temps-forts/fetes-logo-ardoise.png" alt="{{facility_name}}" align="center" width="150px" padding="30px 40px 24px 40px"></mj-image><mj-image src="https://api.trigger-flow.com/images/email-library/temps-forts/cosy-room-600.jpg" alt="Une chambre chaleureuse, prête pour vos invités" padding="0"></mj-image><mj-text align="center" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="13px" line-height="18px" letter-spacing="2px" font-weight="bold" color="#6B2D2A" padding="38px 40px 0 40px"><div style="text-transform:uppercase;">Pour les fêtes en famille</div></mj-text><mj-text css-class="h1" align="center" font-family="Lora, Georgia, serif" font-size="42px" line-height="48px" color="#6B2D2A" padding="14px 40px 0 40px"><div>Votre famille arrive pour Noël ? Elle dort chez nous.</div></mj-text><mj-divider border-color="#C9A45C" border-width="2px" width="56px" padding="24px 40px 0 40px"></mj-divider><mj-text align="center" font-family="Lora, Georgia, serif" font-size="19px" line-height="30px" color="#2E2522" padding="24px 48px 0 48px"><p style="margin:0;">Le canapé du salon ne suffira pas cette année. À [[Temps de trajet|dix minutes]] de chez vous, des chambres attendent vos parents, vos frères et sœurs, et les cousins venus de loin.</p></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section padding="32px 32px 0 32px"><mj-column background-color="#FFFFFF" border-radius="6px" padding="24px 28px 10px 28px"><mj-text font-family="Lora, Georgia, serif" font-size="24px" line-height="30px" font-style="italic" color="#6B2D2A" padding="0 0 12px 0"><div>Qui dort où ?</div></mj-text><mj-table css-class="rows" padding="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td width="170" valign="top" style="border-top:1px solid #C9A45C;padding:14px 0;font-family:Lora, Georgia, serif;font-size:18px;line-height:26px;font-weight:600;color:#6B2D2A;">Les grands-parents</td><td valign="top" style="border-top:1px solid #C9A45C;padding:14px 0;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#2E2522;">Une chambre au calme, pour se reposer entre deux repas de fête.</td></tr><tr><td width="170" valign="top" style="border-top:1px solid #C9A45C;padding:14px 0;font-family:Lora, Georgia, serif;font-size:18px;line-height:26px;font-weight:600;color:#6B2D2A;">Les cousins</td><td valign="top" style="border-top:1px solid #C9A45C;padding:14px 0;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#2E2522;">Leur chambre à eux, et le petit-déjeuner servi le matin.</td></tr><tr><td width="170" valign="top" style="border-top:1px solid #C9A45C;padding:14px 0;font-family:Lora, Georgia, serif;font-size:18px;line-height:26px;font-weight:600;color:#6B2D2A;">Vous</td><td valign="top" style="border-top:1px solid #C9A45C;padding:14px 0;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#2E2522;">Votre maison, votre table, et pas de lit de camp à monter.</td></tr></mj-table></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section padding="0"><mj-column><mj-text align="center" font-family="Lora, Georgia, serif" font-size="18px" line-height="28px" color="#2E2522" padding="30px 48px 0 48px"><p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Pour les familles du quartier : [[Avantage pour les familles du quartier|le petit-déjeuner offert dès deux chambres]].</p><p style="margin:0;color:#6E615B;font-size:16px;">Les nuits les plus demandées : [[Nuits les plus demandées|du 23 au 26 décembre, et le 31]].</p></mj-text><mj-button href="{{booking_page_url}}" align="center" background-color="#6B2D2A" color="#FFFFFF" border-radius="4px" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="16px" font-weight="bold" inner-padding="16px 34px" padding="28px 40px 0 40px">Réserver pour ma famille</mj-button><mj-text align="center" font-family="Lora, Georgia, serif" font-size="16px" line-height="25px" font-style="italic" color="#6E615B" padding="22px 56px 0 56px"><p style="margin:0;">Transférez ce message à ceux qui viennent : ils réservent eux-mêmes, en direct.</p></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section padding="0"><mj-column><mj-text align="center" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="12px" line-height="19px" color="#6E615B" padding="26px 36px 34px 36px"><p style="margin:0;">{{facility_name}}, {{facility_address}}, {{facility_zip_code}} {{facility_city}}<br/>Vous recevez ce message parce que vous avez déjà échangé avec nous. <a href="{{unsubscribe_link}}" style="color:#6B2D2A;text-decoration:underline;">Se désinscrire</a></p></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section></mj-body></mjml>